title: "IHMR: India Health Maintenance Rail"
message: "If you refer to this work, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
abstract: >-
  An open research and engineering project investigating how India could build infrastructure
  for continuous health maintenance at population scale. Contains research, proposals,
  decisions, and experiments, each carrying an explicit epistemic status.
